#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:5
#: 79ba709c4dae46bfb1857bdca2dac904
msgid "Pilot Control Failsafe"
msgstr "飞手控制失效保护"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:7
#: 97f7214f00e944fc8fd11a106a597c99
msgid ""
"Sub provides a failsafe mechanism in case pilot manual control is lost. "
"Pilot control in Sub is provided by either or both of two ways: via GCS "
"MAVLink RC override or Manual Control messages (stimulated by GCS Joystick) "
"or by the optional RC control link."
msgstr ""
"Sub 提供了在飞手手动控制丢失时的失效保护机制。Sub 中的飞手控制可通过以下两种方式之一或同时使用：通过地面站 MAVLink "
"遥控覆盖或手动控制消息（由地面站摇杆触发），或通过可选的遥控链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:10
#: 8d0a806ab0924b458df1001240c8d966
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失效保护的触发条件"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:11
#: 86d5b42667f54a1487dad9c1314fd4a9
msgid ""
"If :ref:`FS_PILOT_INPUT<FS_PILOT_INPUT>` is non-zero, then lack of both "
"valid RC and MAVLink RC overrides from the GCS for greater than "
":ref:`FS_PILOT_TIMEOUT<FS_PILOT_TIMEOUT>` will initiate the Pilot Input "
"failsafe."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`FS_PILOT_INPUT<FS_PILOT_INPUT>` 不为零，则当有效遥控信号和地面站 MAVLink 遥控覆盖同时缺失超过 "
":ref:`FS_PILOT_TIMEOUT<FS_PILOT_TIMEOUT>` 时，将触发飞手输入失效保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:13
#: c291ea3d106f478ab27cf709b5c645cd
msgid ""
"if the RC failsafe is enabled with :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` "
"nonzero, then Pilot Input failsafe will never be activated, only loss of RC "
"will activate a failsafe even if the MAVLink overrides are lost from the "
"GCS."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 非零启用了遥控失效保护，则飞手输入失效保护将永不激活，即使地面站 "
"MAVLink 覆盖丢失，也只有遥控信号丢失才会触发失效保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:16
#: 309fcf039fef4bc7b8e99129e767b590
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "触发后的行为"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:17
#: 5892abb340ba4346878329af7f730b6f
msgid ""
"When a Pilot Control failsafe is triggered, the vehicle can be configured "
"via parameters to do nothing, send the GCS a warning message, or Disarm."
msgstr "当飞手控制失效保护触发时，可通过参数将飞行器配置为：不执行任何操作、向地面站发送警告消息或解除解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:19
#: 4276ba32e6f847d199f9cfdc0373adc2
msgid ""
"If the failsafe clears (i.e. RC control or MAVLink overrides from GCS is "
"restored) the vehicle will remain in its failsafe mode. If it is disarmed, "
"and the pilot wished to re-take control he/she would need to rearm the "
"vehicle . This can be done via RC or GCS."
msgstr ""
"若失效保护解除（即遥控控制或地面站 MAVLink "
"覆盖恢复），飞行器将保持在失效保护模式。若已解除解锁，飞手若想重新取得控制权，需要重新解锁飞行器，可通过遥控或地面站完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:22
#: 9cca70f60cdd4d49a33dd1dae577ccdc
msgid "Setting the failsafe"
msgstr "配置失效保护"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:24
#: 66ae541e1aaf477fb423e10867021c6a
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's  full parameter list or full parameter tree, set the "
":ref:`FS_PILOT_INPUT <FS_PILOT_INPUT>` parameter to:"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，将 :ref:`FS_PILOT_INPUT <FS_PILOT_INPUT>` "
"参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:26
#: 38aaaa61b43d450b92defd79303dd2b7
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the GCS failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用**（值 0）将完全禁用地面站失效保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:27
#: 1c2fdeebdeb54357ac83ed4352c7bc6a
msgid "**Warn Only** (Value 1) will send a GCS warning message."
msgstr "**仅警告**（值 1）将向地面站发送警告消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control-failsafe.rst:28
#: 8a4e7a2c92f045d39bd5daa8506db2bb
msgid "**Disarm** (Value 2)"
msgstr "**解除解锁**（值 2）"
